The declaration lists and exact identities are in allocation-manifest.nota.
The batch configuration copies those identities mechanically and the Nix gate
refuses differences, duplicates, incomplete name coverage, or reordered
translator output.  Any identity or receipt change requires a new explicit
allocation decision; it is not a formatting update.
